                        "form": "лы́жниках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1ff10b8d-160f-3e8d-ab4c-95e1ca6f18aa",
                        "entry_id": "b50ea800-a1ab-343b-807a-cf8c9e79982c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "человек, передвигающийся на лыжах"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "946bfe23-c19a-4481-8bdd-9f2efa94ae3d",
                                "sense_id": "1ff10b8d-160f-3e8d-ab4c-95e1ca6f18aa",
                                "text": "К полудню подъём равнины сделался совершенно незаметным, а под вечер он перешел в спуск — собаки побежали быстрее, так что лыжники едва поспевали за ними."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a9a2f47-f044-40e9-8d38-d67e3f398844",
                                "sense_id": "1ff10b8d-160f-3e8d-ab4c-95e1ca6f18aa",
                                "text": "Там, в отдалении, катер тащит за собою лыжника, который эффектно скользит по волнам, наклоняясь то в ту, то в другую сторону и подымая фонтаны брызг."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4c7f4a88-88eb-366d-ad6e-d1763e61dd57",
                        "entry_id": "b50ea800-a1ab-343b-807a-cf8c9e79982c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спортсмен, занимающийся лыжными видами спорта"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "49af153e-d7d0-418d-91af-156584742784",
                                "sense_id": "4c7f4a88-88eb-366d-ad6e-d1763e61dd57",
                                "text": "Мимо вихрем пронеслась цепочка лёгких, одинаково одетых лыжников — видимо, мастера спорта."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b6cab5c2-55d4-43b6-aec8-52b6667cfcd4",
                        "source_entry_id": "b50ea800-a1ab-343b-807a-cf8c9e79982c",
                        "target_lang_word": "skier",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "skier",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73a1d907-372d-3037-88eb-c416067b314b",
                                        "entry_id": "e23b71b2-7510-34ba-b05a-b65890572ee4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who skis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0fbc0b6-2e09-4ad1-974f-bdcbacae8dbb",
                                                "sense_id": "73a1d907-372d-3037-88eb-c416067b314b",
                                                "text": "a professional skier"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c881799b-11fa-4c81-b061-dfc9051725c9",
                                                "sense_id": "73a1d907-372d-3037-88eb-c416067b314b",
                                                "text": "a poor skier"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf1c05ff-b645-4507-8262-32b0dab8f2aa",
                                                "sense_id": "73a1d907-372d-3037-88eb-c416067b314b",
                                                "text": "Some ski instructors are allowed to take groups off-piste too, so long as they don't travel across glaciers, but the tour hosts and reps who commonly show skiers around pisted runs within large resorts are definitely not allowed to go off-piste […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08396532-4db2-4968-879b-ce96ecbd7134",
                                                "sense_id": "73a1d907-372d-3037-88eb-c416067b314b",
                                                "text": "Townsend hare inhabit this area, particularly above the cabin, and a skier is likely to have one explode from a tree well and disappear into the whiteness as he skis by. Life is a constant bivouac for them -- they spend days huddled in tree wells during storms -- but I suspect they are as content and warm in their luxurious coats as we are in a cabin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "skier",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4627ce7d-6f97-3296-bc1e-23dca316f470",
                                        "entry_id": "fb6df4bb-434e-3e70-94cb-30c2a2e2c29b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ball hit high in the air, often leading to a catch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2d009b0-cb4c-4566-b191-73666e20e704",
                                                "sense_id": "4627ce7d-6f97-3296-bc1e-23dca316f470",
                                                "text": "However, when Guha returned, she picked the wrong ball to pull and hit a skier to Charlotte Edwards."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f7866b4-513f-4e11-8f7d-b97b4f091c39",
                                                "sense_id": "4627ce7d-6f97-3296-bc1e-23dca316f470",
                                                "text": "The second thing I did my best to get out of was the unpleasant position Monty found himself in rather too often in Sri Lanka: standing under a skier in the deep."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c285448f-6bfc-4b46-9efa-7471c895e872",
                        "source_entry_id": "b50ea800-a1ab-343b-807a-cf8c9e79982c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Skifahrer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Skifahrer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32cd1f0f-1d11-3966-a35e-8ba96d19b732",
                                        "entry_id": "0a70a051-6b1e-3b40-8cf0-5a7ebb976749",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand, der Ski fährt; jemand, der das Skifahren betreibt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1d23292-d86f-4a7a-a71d-b7e10ae959e1",
                                                "sense_id": "32cd1f0f-1d11-3966-a35e-8ba96d19b732",
                                                "text": "Manche Skifahrer wollen sich nicht an die Pistenregeln halten und fahren in gesperrten Gebieten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "150ff0a7-700a-418a-8bb7-1a39fd831b10",
                                                "sense_id": "32cd1f0f-1d11-3966-a35e-8ba96d19b732",
                                                "text": "„Und dass der Job bei der Bergwacht von vielen unentgeltlich geleistet wird, scheint manche Skifahrer nicht zu kümmern.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d287aa01-8796-4632-9307-c51a075174b1",
                                                "sense_id": "32cd1f0f-1d11-3966-a35e-8ba96d19b732",
                                                "text": "„Bei so tollem Osterwetter musste man mit Skifahrern aus ganz Island rechnen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5f696b91-df21-4039-940c-54462fd3f0ad",
                        "source_entry_id": "b50ea800-a1ab-343b-807a-cf8c9e79982c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Skiläufer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Skiläufer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f64bcfbd-c958-391f-9b94-73ae5aaad945",
                                        "entry_id": "3e03146d-63d7-3df2-8638-cfd48f7fe37b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand, der Ski läuft; jemand, der das Skilaufen betreibt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "510801ce-1178-45c1-939b-89abce460261",
                                                "sense_id": "f64bcfbd-c958-391f-9b94-73ae5aaad945",
                                                "text": "„Immer mehr Skiläufer trauen sich immer schneller alles zu.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b6acae9-2016-4192-8403-58cffe7a2a5c",
                                                "sense_id": "f64bcfbd-c958-391f-9b94-73ae5aaad945",
                                                "text": "„Skiläufer schossen wie schwarze Kommas durch den Glanz.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
